OL,3,GNEWSAGP services struggling to match
OL,4,Ademand, report finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report into GP services in
OL,7,FOxfordshire has found that practices
OL,8,Facross the county are struggling to
OL,9,Fkeep up with growing demand.
OL,11,FThe inquiry, compiled by the
OL,12,FOxfordshire Joint Health Overview and
OL,13,FScrutiny Committee, also suggested
OL,14,Fsurgeries needed to be planned and
OL,15,Fbuilt alongside new houses, rather than
OL,16,Fafter the estates have been
OL,17,Fconstructed.
OL,19,FCouncillor Jane Hanna, chair of the
OL,20,Fcommittee, said GP provision in the
OL,21,Fcounty "wasn't aligned with the
OL,22,Fpopulation and housing growth".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
